//  with `partialRight` over the given `divide`.
//
//      divideBy(2)(10)                 → 5
//
//  hint: `(...args) => fn(...args, ...preset)` — and note that *every*
//  argument the caller passes lands before the preset, which is why
//  `[10, 20].map(divideBy(2))` does not do what you would hope

